<title>USA: Howell, Schenectady Intl end unit sale talk.</title>
<headline>Howell, Schenectady Intl end unit sale talk.</headline>
<text>
<p>HOUSTON, Oct 4 (Reuter) Howell Corp said on Friday a letter of intent it signed with Schenectady International Inc over Howell's sale of its research, reference fuels and chemical custom manufacturing business had expired.</p>
<p>The diversified independent energy company said it did not expect further sale negotiations with Schenectady.</p>
<p>Howell was not immediately available for further comment.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
